1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,173
"Your Mac is severely damaged. Clean now!"

2
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:04,427
Yeah... no.

3
00:00:04,627 --> 00:00:08,201
Some Mac cleaner apps scare you first, and explain never.

4
00:00:08,351 --> 00:00:10,059
Here's what you actually want instead.

5
00:00:10,309 --> 00:00:13,691
One: it shows you exactly what it'll do, before it does it.

6
00:00:13,941 --> 00:00:17,128
Two: nothing gets erased. Cleared files go to the Trash.

7
00:00:17,378 --> 00:00:19,433
Three: a log of every change.

8
00:00:19,683 --> 00:00:23,036
Four: no fake alarms. And you can always say no.

9
00:00:23,286 --> 00:00:24,443
That's how Noah works.

10
00:00:24,693 --> 00:00:26,595
Noah for Mac. Free to start.

11
00:00:26,895 --> 00:00:28,421
And close that pop-up.
